# Product-molecularity fixture: 30 A(l,r) bind head to tail into chains, and the
# bonds break again. With block_same_complex_binding=False the binding rule may
# close a chain into a ring, and the two reactants of a binding can sit in one
# complex beyond each other's traversal limit. NFsim listed the molecules their
# neighbourhoods share twice and added them to the Molecules observables twice,
# so the conserved total Atot drifted up to 84-98. It must stay 30.
begin model
begin parameters
  kf 1
  kb 1
end parameters
begin molecule types
  A(l,r)
end molecule types
begin seed species
  A(l,r) 30
end seed species
begin observables
  Molecules Atot A()
end observables
begin reaction rules
  A(r) + A(l) -> A(r!1).A(l!1) kf
  A(r!1).A(l!1) -> A(r) + A(l) kb
end reaction rules
end model
writeXML()
